517
00:29:51.664 --> 00:29:53.333
-Tidak, tunggu.
-Pergi saja.

518
00:29:55.126 --> 00:29:56.002
Satu dua tiga!

519
00:29:56.085 --> 00:29:57.670
Minggir.

520
00:30:00.548 --> 00:30:02.759
Kami terus berjalan hingga detik terakhir

521
00:30:02.842 --> 00:30:05.929
