663
00:38:09.036 --> 00:38:11.080
Ayo, tim! Ayo lakukan ini!

664
00:38:13.332 --> 00:38:16.127
Bagus, Isai! Bagus, Isai!

665
00:38:16.752 --> 00:38:17.670
Ayo!

666
